## Why This Is Asked

Assesses multi-account isolation, tenant tagging, and rapid containment capabilities in AWS.

## Key Concepts

- ABAC with aws:PrincipalTag
- SCPs and cross-account trust boundaries
- Tenant-scoped KMS keys with rotation
- PrivateLink/VPCE for data paths
- Immutable logging and breach-testing

## Code Example

```javascript
// trust policy snippet (conceptual)
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "sts:AssumeRole",
      "Resource": "*",
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {"aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id": "${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id}"}
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

